NOTICE — upstream attributions

This repository compiles domain lists from three upstream projects. All
credit for the underlying data belongs to them:

1. OONI (Open Observatory of Network Interference) — https://ooni.org
   Measurement data on network interference, collected by probes worldwide.
   Compiled into a per-domain dataset by Yuix-Networks/blocked-sites-dataset:
   https://github.com/Yuix-Networks/blocked-sites-dataset
   Contributes: list.txt and data/domains.jsonl (domains confirmed blocked
   inside Iran). License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

2. bootmortis/iran-hosted-domains — https://github.com/bootmortis/iran-hosted-domains
   Domains hosted in Iran, gathered from the official Iranian domain
   registries (ITO / Enamad), distributed in cleaned routing-list form by
   Chocolate4U/Iran-clash-rules:
   https://github.com/Chocolate4U/Iran-clash-rules
   Contributes: blocked-from-outside.txt.

3. freedomofdevelopers/fod — https://github.com/freedomofdevelopers/fod
   Community-maintained list of foreign services that block Iranian users
   (sanctions / geo-blocking).
   Contributes: blocked-by-sanctions.txt.

